* corners.lib - process corners for the generic trimmed reference
* SPDX-License-Identifier: CC0-1.0
* Written for the Omnia P0.3 spike. Generic parameters, no vendor data.
.lib TT
.param VREF_TRIM=0
.model DREF_TT D(IS=1e-14 N=1.0)
.endl TT
.lib FF
.param VREF_TRIM=0.01
.model DREF_TT D(IS=2e-14 N=0.98)
.endl FF
